    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4971" root="جبس" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَبَّاسَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>place of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِبْس</span>; [i. e., <i>in which
gypsum is found,</i> or <i>prepared;</i>] as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مجبَّسة</span>
[i. e. ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُجَبَّسَةٌ</span></b> , or, more probably, it is a mistranscription, for ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجْبَسَةٌ</span></b> , like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْصَاةٌ</span> (originally
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَصَيَةٌ</span>) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَبْقَلَةٌ</span> &amp;c.]. (TA.)

